Just 10 months ago, with Maduro still in power, a democratic future for Venezuela seemed inconceivable. Today, a free Venezuela is within reach thanks to @POTUS resolve and the extraordinary service of the brave men and women of our U.S. Armed Forces.

@SecRubio has been instrumental in bringing Venezuela to this historic moment, and I have every confidence in his leadership to see this transition through to free and fair presidential elections.

